          "jcr:createdBy": "hannah.white@stryker.com",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "kristian.bocage@stryker.com",
          "jcr:created": "Thu Sep 19 2024 18:59:50 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><b>PORTAGE, Mich. – Oct. 1, 2024</b>&nbsp;–&nbsp;Stryker (NYSE: SYK) announced today that it has completed the acquisition of Vertos Medical Inc., a leader in interventional pain management solutions for chronic lower back pain caused by lumbar spinal stenosis.</p>\n<p>“The acquisition of Vertos Medical enhances our unique, non-surgical solutions for interventionalists addressing chronic lower back pain, while broadening our presence in ambulatory surgery centers,&quot; said Andy Pierce, Group President, MedSurg and Neurotechnology, Stryker. “We look forward to enabling physicians with the minimally invasive mild® procedure so patients can reclaim their quality of life.”</p>\n<p>The addition of Vertos Medical’s differentiated portfolio will strengthen Stryker’s impact in interventional solutions to address chronic pain.</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Sep 30 2024 20:14:30 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        },
        "sectionseparator": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
